                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Conan the mighty pig is not just a game about a pig collecting truffles, its a game about the endless pursuit of happiness. Every truffle Conan grabs he lets out a sound of contentment for he knows soon his deed will be rewarded. This game is not just a game, it is a lesson every human and pig should learn. Anyways, fuck the bees. The ghost made me pee a little. My friend liked it, were getting married in July next year. My brother was watching m play this game and he got into a car accident because he was distracted by Conan's greatness and he broke his femur and tibia in 8 different places and now he has to eat with a straw. 10/10 game, needs a remaster. dank epic dat boii watch him roll trololol.",
